            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kolimok Turo ebe, Wu jo loiboie kaneelomarere aŋolol, loirai ekagwelanaran loka atekerin mama ejaas apujana, inera kwanata Ejakait EDEKE ebe:",
          "type": "text",
